        "original_id": "750a5844-ef29-5e27-b17e-cba3dfd610ed",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Wherever You Will Go\", \"Smooth\"\n- Bands and Artists: The Calling, Santana, Rob Thomas\n- Places: Los Angeles, California\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100, Adult Top 40\n\nFacts:\n- The Calling was an American rock band from Los Angeles, California.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" was the debut single by the American band The Calling.\n- The Calling was best known for its hit single \"Wherever You Will Go\".\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" was The Calling's most renowned and most successful hit.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" peaked at number 5 on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" topped the Adult Top 40 chart for 23 weeks.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" had the second longest-running number-one run in Adult Top 40 history, behind \"Smooth\" by Santana and Rob Thomas.",
